{</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>.<span class=\"me1\">f</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> x <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"nu17\">8.8f</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> x <span class=\"sy2\">+</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu17\">0.3565f</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        v.<span class=\"me1\">push_back</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">expint</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>x<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    draw_vbars<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">9</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>v<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>Ei(0) = -inf\nEi(1) = 1.89512\nGompertz constant = 0.596347\n                                          █ ┬ 666.505\n                                          █ │\n                                        ▆ █ │\n                                        █ █ │\n                                      █ █ █ │\n                                    ▆ █ █ █ │\n                                ▁ ▆ █ █ █ █ │\n                            ▂ ▅ █ █ █ █ █ █ │\n▁ ▁ ▁ ▁ ▁ ▁ ▁ ▂ ▂ ▃ ▃ ▄ ▆ ▇ █ █ █ █ █ █ █ █ ┴ 1.89512</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"External_links\">External links</h3>\n<table>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mathworld.wolfram.com/ExponentialIntegral.html\" data-external=\"1\">Weisstein, Eric W. \"Exponential Integral.\"</a> From MathWorld — A Wolfram Web Resource.\n</td></tr></table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Error handling","id":"Error_handling"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Exampl